### Create a course
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "CS101", "name": "Intro to Computer Science", "credits": 3 }

### Create a student
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentNo": "2024001", "name": "Alice Chen", "email": "alice@example.com", "age": 20, "major": "Computer Science" }

### List students (search + paging)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?keyword=ali&page=0&size=10&sortBy=id&direction=desc

### Get one student
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1

### Update a student
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentNo": "2024001", "name": "Alice Chen", "email": "alice@example.com", "age": 21, "major": "Software Engineering" }

### Enroll student 1 in course 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/courses/1

### Drop the course
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/courses/1

### Validation error demo (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentNo": "", "name": "", "email": "not-an-email", "age": 200 }

### Delete a student (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/1

### List courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses
